# === Bundled MCP Dependencies (uv seed binaries) ===
# Editor~ is ignored by Unity's asset pipeline but MUST be tracked by git so
# the bundled uv binaries ship with the package. Parent unignore first —
# otherwise the global *~ pattern (Vim backup files) swallows Editor~ whole
# and no deeper !exception can rescue it.
!/Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/Editor~/
!/Packages/com.coplaydev.unity-mcp/Editor~/**

